{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Update a task"},"description":"Look after a task: mark it done (`done`, with an optional `note` of\nwhat was done and the `day`, today if left out), move it to another\n`due_date`, or rename it (`title`). `skip` takes it off the list for\nthis season (a guide's task the person will not do) and `unskip` brings\nit back; `remove` deletes a task the person added themselves, and a\ntask from a guide is skipped instead. Skip, unskip and remove stand\nalone. Only what is passed changes. Pass the same `client_id` (a UUID)\nto retry safely.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"client_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Client Id"},"day":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Day"},"done":{"default":false,"title":"Done","type":"boolean"},"due_date":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Due Date"},"farm_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Farm Id"},"note":{"default":"","title":"Note","type":"string"},"remove":{"default":false,"title":"Remove","type":"boolean"},"skip":{"default":false,"title":"Skip","type":"boolean"},"task_id":{"title":"Task Id","type":"string"},"title":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Title"},"unskip":{"default":false,"title":"Unskip","type":"boolean"}},"required":["task_id"],"title":"update_taskArguments","type":"object"},"name":"update_task","outputSchema":{"properties":{"due_date":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Due Date"},"farm_id":{"title":"Farm Id","type":"string"},"link":{"title":"Link","type":"string"},"status":{"title":"Status","type":"string"},"summary":{"title":"Summary","type":"string"},"task_id":{"title":"Task Id","type":"string"},"title":{"t